{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_01",
      "hash": "28fceded578acd02",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨～！\\n未来的冠军！\\c\\n在这个道馆……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_01",
      "hash": "5d983f69274032b5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：嘿～～～！\\n第１题！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_02",
      "hash": "28fceced578acb4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "等一下啦，夏伯！\\n还没到您出场呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_02",
      "hash": "5d983c6927402d9c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：是嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_03",
      "hash": "28fcebed578ac99c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呃，刚才那位大叔\\n就是红莲道馆的馆主夏伯！\\r\\n他是一位火属性的专家！\\c\\n先不说别的，\\n亏你能找得到[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘密钥匙[VAR COLOR(0000)]啊！\\r\\n那就批准你挑战道馆吧！\\c\\n在这座道馆，\\n你还将挑战谜题问答！\\r\\n敬请期待！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_04",
      "hash": "28fceaed578ac7e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了好了！请往里走，\\n尽情享受谜题和对战的乐趣！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_05",
      "hash": "28fce9ed578ac636",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，你赢了吗！\\n夏伯确实是个热血沸腾的大叔吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_03",
      "hash": "5d983d6927402f4f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：怎么说！\\n可以开始了吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_04",
      "hash": "5d983a6927402a36",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_05",
      "hash": "5d983b6927402be9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "很好，请站到那里吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_06",
      "hash": "5d983869274026d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：嘿～～～！\\n接下来是红莲道馆为你带来的\\r\\n宝可梦谜题问答～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_07",
      "hash": "5d98396927402883",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接下来将请挑战者回答５道问题！\\c\\n答对问题之后，\\n便可获得夏伯玩偶！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_08",
      "hash": "5d98466927403e9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果答错问题，\\n那就要请你\\r\\n和我的训练家徒弟们对战了唷！\\c\\n如果能战胜他们，\\n你也将获得夏伯玩偶！\\c\\n不知你是否能\\n成功得到５个夏伯玩偶呢！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_09",
      "hash": "5d9847692740404d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：那么马上开始。\\n第１题！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_01",
      "hash": "ff3cc2b88ab47450",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "问题！\\c\\n“吐火宝可梦”指的是？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_01",
      "hash": "427ed350510c0079",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "鸭嘴火兽"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_02",
      "hash": "427ed050510bfb60",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡蒂狗"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_10",
      "hash": "5d9b44692742710b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：接下来！\\n就是第２题喽～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_02",
      "hash": "ff3cc5b88ab47969",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "问题！\\c\\n宝可梦联盟认证的\\n道馆徽章一共有几个？"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_03",
      "hash": "427ed150510bfd13",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "７个"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_04",
      "hash": "427ed650510c0592",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "８个"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_11",
      "hash": "5d9b436927426f58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：接下来还有唷～！\\n第２题！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main8060_gym_06",
      "hash": "28fce8ed578ac483",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "叔叔：等等，夏伯！\\n应该是第３题了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_12",
      "hash": "5d9b466927427471",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：第３题！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_03",
      "hash": "ff3cc4b88ab477b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "问题！\\c\\n对火属性的宝可梦\\n使用钢属性招式时的效果为……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_05",
      "hash": "427ed750510c0745",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "效果绝佳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_06",
      "hash": "427ed450510c022c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "效果不好"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_quiz_01_p04_t009_r0101",
      "hash": "03ef5b9403184a86",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 27]"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_quiz_01_p06_t009_r0101",
      "hash": "a2bea715e3569344",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 28]"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_13",
      "hash": "5d9b4569274272be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：好唷！\\c\\n这位挑战者表现精彩，\\n到现在为止的３个夏伯玩偶\\r\\n都拿到了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_29",
      "hash": "5d913b69273a0d3b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "接下来是第４题！"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_04",
      "hash": "ff3cc7b88ab47ccf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "问题！\\c\\n“招式学习器28”指的是\\n“死死光线”这个招式吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_07",
      "hash": "427ed550510c03df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_08",
      "hash": "427eda50510c0c5e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不是"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_09",
      "hash": "427edb50510c0e11",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什么玩意！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_14",
      "hash": "5d9b4869274277d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：现在挑战者\\n已经得到了４个夏伯玩偶！\\c\\n接下来是最后的问题！\\n请拿出万分的精神来答题！"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_05",
      "hash": "ff3cc6b88ab47b1c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "最后一题！\\c\\n挑战者[VAR TRNAME(0000)]接下来\\n将要对战的对手是谁！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_10",
      "hash": "42825850510f184f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_11",
      "hash": "42825750510f169c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "红莲道馆馆主"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_12",
      "hash": "42825a50510f1bb5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "火属性的专家"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_13",
      "hash": "42825950510f1a02",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "热血猜谜大叔"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_14",
      "hash": "42825450510f1183",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可能是夏伯吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_15",
      "hash": "42825350510f0fd0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "就是你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_16",
      "hash": "42825650510f14e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 43]"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "msg_main8060_select_17",
      "hash": "42825550510f1336",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 44]"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_15",
      "hash": "5d9b476927427624",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：挑战者回答完了唷！\\n那么这题的结果就是……！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_06",
      "hash": "ff3cc9b88ab48035",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "灰！常！正！确！\\n答对了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_07",
      "hash": "ff3cc8b88ab47e82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "糟糕，你答错了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_16",
      "hash": "5d9b4a6927427b3d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：热烈祝贺～！\\n恭喜你获得夏伯玩偶～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_17",
      "hash": "5d9b49692742798a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：震撼哀叹！\\n没能答对真是遗憾！\\c\\n请挑战者对战吧！\\n训练家徒弟！上场！"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_18",
      "hash": "5d9b3c6927426373",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：漂亮的胜利！\\n恭喜你获得夏伯玩偶！"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_19",
      "hash": "5d9b3b69274261c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯：嘿～～～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_24",
      "hash": "5d913669273a04bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "以灰常完美的技术成功拿到\\n５个夏伯玩偶的挑战者唷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_25",
      "hash": "5d913769273a066f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "对战的时刻\\n马上就要来临喽～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_26",
      "hash": "5d913869273a0822",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我就是熊熊燃烧的男人——\\n红莲岛宝可梦道馆的夏伯！"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_27",
      "hash": "5d913969273a09d5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我的宝可梦全部都是\\n经历过烈火燃烧重重淬炼的勇者！"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_28",
      "hash": "5d913a69273a0b88",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘿～～～！\\n灼伤药都准备好了吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_07_02",
      "hash": "a4212e53d369a560",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 57]"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_23",
      "hash": "5d913569273a0309",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你正是！\\n获得深红徽章的不二人选！"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_08",
      "hash": "ff3ccbb88ab4839b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从夏伯那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]深红徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_20",
      "hash": "5d9132692739fdf0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "还有！\\n你就收下这个招式学习器吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "msg_main8060_sys_09",
      "hash": "ff3ccab88ab481e8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从夏伯那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n“[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_21",
      "hash": "5d9133692739ffa3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式学习器46是\\n“大字爆炎”这个炽热的强大招式！\\c\\n你可以把大字爆炎\\n教给火属性的宝可梦！\\c\\n让六尾或者火恐龙\\n学会它一定没错！"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "msg_main8060_fire_22",
      "hash": "5d913469273a0156",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽然大家都管这个招式\\n叫作“大字烧烧”，\\r\\n但这是灰常不对的！\\c\\n在正规场合应该把它叫作\\n“大字爆炎”或者“送神之火”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_07_13",
      "hash": "a424b753d36cc402",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 64]"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_01_01",
      "hash": "e734b77852176f89",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "今天也好期待\\n热血沸腾的谜题唷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_01_02",
      "hash": "e734b47852176a70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "对战非常精彩唷！\\n连我这个老头子也燃起来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_02_01",
      "hash": "b85eb76044c5f3d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不知道还有没有其他的\\n火属性道馆馆主呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldm_02_02",
      "hash": "b85eb66044c5f223",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你也很厉害嘛。\\n是要成为道馆馆主吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldw_01",
      "hash": "b9fb0fcd6a945377",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽然夏伯的主持能力有点那个，\\n对战的时候他可是很有一手的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "id": "msg_main8060_oldw_02",
      "hash": "b9fb10cd6a94552a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯和你都干得非常漂亮！"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "id": "msg_main8060_nresearcher_01",
      "hash": "c8aa82fb5a887513",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "为了让住在红莲镇的\\n研究员的家人不要感到沉闷，\\c\\n夏伯先生真的是\\n为他们动足了脑筋呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childm_01",
      "hash": "b995ef96c9f32a92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊哈哈！\\n夏伯真逗！"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childm_02",
      "hash": "b995ee96c9f328df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好想要夏伯玩偶～"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "id": "msg_main8060_middlew_01",
      "hash": "9ce1049e473a73e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "对于什么都没有的红莲镇来说，\\n这里真是我们唯一的乐趣。"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "id": "msg_main8060_middlew_02",
      "hash": "9ce1019e473a6ed0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "最近厉害的挑战者越来越多，\\n我们也一点都不无聊了呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childf_01",
      "hash": "4879fff09d725dfd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "加油啊，训练家～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "id": "msg_main8060_childf_02",
      "hash": "4879fcf09d7258e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "谜题问答那时候，\\n训练家你的\\r\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]超可爱的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "id": "msg_main8060_boy_01",
      "hash": "e75cfb1b89c05ad1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我不是训练家，\\n不过夏伯说我也可以来观看！"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "id": "msg_main8060_boy_02",
      "hash": "e75cf81b89c055b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "谜题问答的题目之中，\\n有一题我也知道答案哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "8abc15877b5e3e17",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你知道宝可梦喷出的火\\n温度有多高吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "f3e884c4b24e3400",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 81]"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "98b31de0b287c8e1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "燃烧这个反应呢，\\n说的就是空气中的氧气啊……\\c\\n这样那样……呜哩嘛哩。"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "51c090c3a274e934",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "俺曾经是个强盗，\\n但是俺已经金盆洗手，\\r\\n在此开始了俺的修行。"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "68bceb3de49b2b21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 84]"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_04_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "8823de5b821025d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "俺只要一看到别人的宝可梦，\\n就会产生把它偷过来的冲动！"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "a04f035ee09f091e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你知道夏伯\\n成为训练家的契机是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "749b8fb17f524777",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 87]"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "id": "TRID_SCIENCE_08_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "e50edd97b678cba4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "夏伯在登山途中遇到山难时，\\n有一只燃烧着的鸟宝可梦飞来，\\r\\n帮他照亮了漆黑的山路！\\c\\n就因为这样，\\n夏伯最后才能平安下山。"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_START",
      "hash": "6128544511eb2a5b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我去过许多道馆，\\n感觉这座道馆才是最适合我的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE",
      "hash": "589467d7a51fbfe4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 90]"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "id": "TRID_THIEF_05_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER",
      "hash": "f239b69c243817cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "火属性宝可梦的话，\\n烈焰马、九尾这一些比较受欢迎。"
    }
  ],
